{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Description]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/7969fe25542c65751eeb9df48c75218a.avif?t=1759131021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras_big/7969fe25542c65751eeb9df48c75218a.avif?t=1759131021 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing truth lies behind a chance meeting. What awaits at the end is tragedy\u2014or something worse.<br>And your choices are the only way forward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote mansion shrouded in monochrome, unsettling silence creeps through the halls. Unexpected guests. Unwelcome events.<br>And at the center of it all: you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision twists the story further. One choice can doom a life\u2014or save it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a branching narrative with multiple endings\u2014some darker than others.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/c982bb09c4e116ecb9b13c51ca587e69.avif?t=1759131021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras_big/c982bb09c4e116ecb9b13c51ca587e69.avif?t=1759131021 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a model citizen, praised for your generous donations and tireless volunteer work.<br>One night, caught in a downpour, you\u2019re helped by a stranger on the roadside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That stranger leads you to a secluded mansion where several others have also gathered, seemingly by chance.<br>At first, everything feels strangely normal. Too normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by morning, a cold corpse is found.<br>Who did it?<br>And why?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/1477f5381c4a8a8a6dfd30c96cf29982.avif?t=1759131021\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fear spreads, you must uncover the hidden truth and fight to survive.<br>Trust no one. Terror may be closer than you think.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So... this is how it ends.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A model citizen known for charity and good deeds.<br>Lost in a storm after work, you hitch a ride and end up at a mansion that will change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/90ccc541706cc72281c3e62563af88cf.avif?t=1759131021\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kali</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It's been so long since I've shared a meal with someone...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mansion\u2019s sorrowful owner. A reclusive mystery novelist mourning her late husband.<br>Her delicate beauty masks the deep grief she carries. There's something fragile\u2014almost haunting\u2014about her presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/b230b3eb6f5dee8afa3efedc041d1979.avif?t=1759131021\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everyone gathered here has their own story.<br>Whether this night ends with a simple dinner... I honestly couldn't say.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A serious, devout doctor who stumbles upon the mansion after an emergency call.<br>He believes your meeting was divine intervention. Calm, stern, and unwavering in faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/c19addda448c6db838a2ca3842526a36.avif?t=1759131021\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belladonna</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll tear you apart, piece by piece! Don't you forget it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fierce and glamorous personal secretary stranded en route during the storm.<br>She\u2019s all fire and venom, radiating raw hostility with every word and glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/4225bd5850eade1582aeb11c48bb40a0.avif?t=1759131021\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rivers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have a feeling tonight's going to be very entertaining!<br>Let's hope it stays... peaceful.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suave and capable accountant returning from a business trip.<br>Though polite, he exudes an unsettling calm. Something about his smile suggests secrets best left buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/extras/781c85b073cf68a4f733ccf046e7212a.avif?t=1759131021\" width=750 height=400 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Deepest Emotion in Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/1b5059fcac555b3033a519f19dfad42f14b92535.jpg"},{"name":"Soup for the Soul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/6b2dcc6112a3bfed7fa36053ffcbd8cb8053a973.jpg"},{"name":"Harmonious Salad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/e0b72ba780a9e9b311a9f51ff810c30b9456b4e7.jpg"},{"name":"Better the Day Before","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/34d2c896f87c19b2a396a30d956586a17d1ec273.jpg"},{"name":"The Sweetest Moment in Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/dfdcd2ceb1f1263532744b3f49a49a63d11a97f8.jpg"},{"name":"Wine as Unchanging Proof","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/a076cc1bdd902fb47dfa5bef56f0629e8b7445d3.jpg"},{"name":"The Woman I Loved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/e8fc85f372d314dcc6612a138c5dcfde3105d8ce.jpg"},{"name":"The Teacher I Admired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/adc549c9bcaccdfc64e2f1cbcc8994d3c013beac.jpg"},{"name":"The Colleague I Both Loved and Hated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/67109616c7e2a1ab959ac5e2fb2179a0b3373486.jpg"},{"name":"The Man in Confusion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3709690/22d83454921aa81d1d1ef969c95b95947da741af.jpg"}],"total":66},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709690?t=1759131021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/a53e8e249c3299d5e0a2111b35fae661aba3fd31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759131021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709690/1d3072a509e8746a1e4f3084f0b89f1a77c1932f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759131021","capsule_imagev5":"htt